        "goal_understanding": "Navigate each grid-based level to step onto and complete every goal cell. A goal only completes when the carried piece matches that goal\u2019s required shape, color, and rotation at the moment you step onto it; completing all goals advances to the next level, and finishing all levels wins.",
        "mechanics_understanding": "Each move (N/S/E/W) costs 1 stamina and cannot be made in any direction listed in blocked_directions (walls/obstacles). When stamina reaches 0, you lose 1 life and stamina resets to its maximum; losing all lives ends the game. Stepping on modifier tiles changes the carried piece: shape cycles through 0\u20135, color cycles orange\u2192blue\u2192green\u2192red\u2192orange, and rotation cycles 0\u00b0\u219290\u00b0\u2192180\u00b0\u2192270\u00b0\u21920\u00b0; rotation modifiers apply a 90\u00b0 clockwise turn. You must route through these modifiers to reach the exact required piece state before stepping onto a goal cell to activate/complete it."
